    # fails that checksum and was the confirmed cause of the
    # "Citation metadata load failed" error on the v0.1.0 archive attempt
    # (traced directly in zenodo-rdm's source, not inferred). orcid is
    # optional in this schema, so omitting it entirely is valid; add a
    # real ORCID back in once one exists.
